<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<catalogue xmlns="http://www.battlescribe.net/schema/catalogueSchema" id="opr36-der-catalogue" name="Dark Elf Raiders - Completed" revision="3" battleScribeVersion="2.03" library="false" gameSystemId="b174-c09d-3660-f001" gameSystemRevision="5"><sharedRules><rule id="der36-r2-00001" name="Harassing" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, this model may move by up to 3&quot; after shooting or being in melee.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00002" name="Agile" hidden="false"><description>Moves +1&quot; when using Advance, and +2&quot; when using Rush/Charge.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00003" name="Crossing Strike" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, when this model moves through enemy units, pick one of them and attack it with this weapon as if it was shooting. This weapon may only be used in this way.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00004" name="Dodge" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have this rule, as long as they aren't Fatigued, enemy units get -1 to hit rolls in melee against them.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00005" name="Enhanced Harassing" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Harassing, they may move by up to 6&quot; from Harassing (instead of only 3&quot;).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00006" name="Enhanced Hit &amp; Run" hidden="false"><description>If most models in this unit have Hit &amp; Run, they may move by up to 6&quot; from Hit &amp; Run (instead of only 3&quot;).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00007" name="Heavy Impact" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Impact(X) with hits that have AP(1).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00008" name="Hit &amp; Run" hidden="false"><description>Once per round, this model may move by up to 3&quot; after shooting or being in melee.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-00009" name="Infiltrate" hidden="false"><description>Counts as having Ambush, but may be deployed anywhere over 3&quot; away from enemy unit.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000a" name="Lacerate" hidden="false"><description>When attacking, the target must re-roll unmodified Defense results of 6.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000b" name="Martial Prowess" hidden="false"><description>Once per game, if all models in this unit have this rule, it may be activated even if it had already activated this round (stops being Fatigued when activated again). Only up to one third of the units in the army with this rule at the beginning of the game (rounding up) may use it in a single round.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000c" name="Melee Shrouding" hidden="false"><description>When a unit where most models have this rule is targeted by an enemy unit for charging, that enemy unit gets -2&quot; range to a min. of 6&quot;.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000d" name="Melee Slayer" hidden="false"><description>When charging, this model's weapons get AP(+2) if most models in the target have Tough(3) or higher.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000e" name="Piercing Frenzy" hidden="false"><description>Place one token on this unit when it fully destroys an enemy unit, up to a max. of two tokens. For each token all models with this rule in this unit get AP(+1) on their weapons when attacking until the end of the game.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000f" name="Piercing Marksman" hidden="false"><description>When shooting at enemies over 9&quot; away, this model's weapons get AP(+1).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000g" name="Precision Fighting Mark" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which friendly units get +1 to hit rolls in melee against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000h" name="Regeneration Buff" hidden="false"><description>Once per activation, before attacking, pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets Regeneration once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000i" name="Regenerative Strength" hidden="false"><description>Place one token on this model when it ignores a wound. Once per round, when it's this model's turn to strike in melee, roll as many dice as tokens on it before attacking, unless this unit is Fatigued. For each 4+ the target takes one wound.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000j" name="Unpredictable Fighter" hidden="false"><description>When in melee, roll one die and apply one effect to all models with this rule: on a 1-3 they get AP(+1) on their weapons, and on a 4-6 they get +1 to hit rolls instead.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000k" name="Vanguard" hidden="false"><description>After this model is deployed, it may be placed anywhere fully within 9&quot; of its position, over 9&quot; away from non-Vanguard enemy units.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000l" name="Bravery Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get +1 to Morale Test rolls.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000m" name="Enhanced Harassing Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Enhanced Harassing.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000n" name="Furious Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Furious.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000o" name="Melee Shrouding Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Melee Shrouding.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000p" name="Piercing Marksman Aura" hidden="false"><description>This model and its unit get Piercing Marksman.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000q" name="Psy-Adrenaline (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one friendly unit within 12&quot;, which gets Enhanced Harassing once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000r" name="Art of Pain (1)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 6&quot;, which takes 1 hit with AP(2) and Deadly(3).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000s" name="Raiding Drugs (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to two enemy units within 18&quot; in line of sight, which friendly units get +1 to hit rolls in melee against once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000t" name="Snake Bite (2)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 4 hits with Lacerate.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000u" name="Fade in the Dark (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick up to three friendly units within 18&quot;, which get Stealth once (next time the effect would apply).</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000v" name="Holistic Suffering (3)" hidden="false"><description>Pick one enemy unit within 18&quot; in line of sight, which takes 9 hits.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-der-0001y" name="Anti-Cover" hidden="false"><description>When attacking with this weapon, ignore the target's cover protection.</description></rule><rule id="opr36-der-001fr" name="Armor(2)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 2+.</description></rule><rule id="der36-r2-0000w" name="Armor(4)" hidden="false"><description>While the item granting this rule is equipped, this model uses Defense 4+.</description></rule></sharedRules><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="opr-spellcat-der-entry" name="Spell Catalogue" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="der36-r2-00204" name="Spell Catalogue" targetId="opr-spell-catalogue-category" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><infoLinks><infoLink id="der36-r2-00205" name="Psy-Adrenaline (1)" targetId="der36-r2-0000q" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="der36-r2-00206" name="Art of Pain (1)" targetId="der36-r2-0000r" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="der36-r2-00207" name="Raiding Drugs (2)" targetId="der36-r2-0000s" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="der36-r2-00208" name="Snake Bite (2)" targetId="der36-r2-0000t" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="der36-r2-00209" name="Fade in the Dark (3)" targetId="der36-r2-0000u" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="der36-r2-0020a" name="Holistic Suffering (3)" targetId="der36-r2-0000v" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><constraints><constraint id="der36-r2-0020b" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/><constraint id="der36-r2-0020c" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true"/></constraints></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="der36-r2-0004m" name="Dark Lord" type="unit" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><categoryLinks><categoryLink id="der36-r2-0004i" name="Heroes" targetId="b174-c09d-3660-f041" primary="true" hidden="false"/></categoryLinks><profiles><profile id="der36-r2-0004j" name="Dark Lord" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f010" typeName="Unit" hidden="false"><characteristics><characteristic name="Quality" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f011">3+</characteristic><characteristic name="Defense" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f012">4+</characteristic><characteristic name="Special Rules" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f013">Harassing, Hero, Tough(3)</characteristic></characteristics></profile></profiles><infoLinks><infoLink id="der36-r2-0004k" name="Harassing" targetId="der36-r2-00001" type="rule" hidden="false"/><infoLink id="der36-r2-0004l" name="Hero" targetId="opr-core-hero" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="der36-r2-0004h" name="Model 1" type="model" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="der36-r2-0004f" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="der36-r2-0004g" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntryGroups><selectionEntryGroup id="der36-r2-00011" name="Upgrade with one role" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><constraints><constraint id="der36-r2-00012" type="min" value="0" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="der36-r2-00013" type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/></constraints><selectionEntries><selectionEntry id="der36-r2-0000x" name="Alchemist" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="der36-r2-00014" name="Melee Shrouding Aura" targetId="der36-r2-0000o" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="5"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="der36-r2-0000y" name="Raid Leader" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="der36-r2-00015" name="Enhanced Harassing Aura" targetId="der36-r2-0000m" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="15"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="der36-r2-0000z" name="Agoniser" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="der36-r2-00016" name="Furious Aura" targetId="der36-r2-0000n" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="25"/></costs></selectionEntry><selectionEntry id="der36-r2-00010" name="Tormentor" type="upgrade" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true"><infoLinks><infoLink id="der36-r2-00017" name="Piercing Marksman Aura" targetId="der36-r2-0000p" type="rule" hidden="false"/></infoLinks><costs><cost name="pts" typeId="b174-c09d-3660-f002" value="35"/></costs></selectionEntry></selectionEntries></selectionEntryGroup><selectionEntryGroup id="der36-r2-0003h" name="Replace Haze-Launcher and Hand Weapon" hidden="false" collective="false" import="true" defaultSelectionEntryId="der36-r2-0003e"><constraints><constraint id="der36-r2-0003i" type="min" value="1" field="selections" scope="parent" shared="true"/><constraint id="der36-r2-0003j"